ry dashboard/report-list reads worked for the same reporters. Support received no reports from other regions by 10:02, but that is a count of reports, not evidence that other regions had zero failures. No cause is asserted here.\",\n  \"confidence\": 0.95,\n  \"sourceArtifactId\": \"art_6aa8bc75b3c74f73\",\n  \"currentness\": \"current\"\n}","metadata":{"truncated":false},"title":"","time":{"start":1791434104848,"end":1791434104868}},"id":"prt_119cb19a800124URp9gdAVp4Nj","sessionID":"ses_ee6357b88ffe0pZB3ogcBnOHmr","messageID":"msg_119cafcbd001ojXcVTZa4VNXLX"}}
