{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1791434127868,"sessionID":"ses_ee6357b88ffe0pZB3ogcBnOHmr","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"campfire_add_decision","callID":"call_00_fdg9w83svy07xklg3kik2mzz","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"workspaceId":"ws_66892b28c1d640a8","status":"proposed","summary":"Proposed: for the next shift, acquire correlated end-to-end evidence on IAD /v1/exports failures (100% tracing + export-specific DB/pool metrics) before selecting any remediation; change no production system without incident-lead approval.","rationale":"The cause is not established and there is no correlated gateway+application+database trace for any failed export; the DB p95 elevation (~1 s) is far below the 30 s timeout and is all-routes aggregate, so it cannot alone justify a targeted fix. Acting before narrowing the cause risks masking the fault. This decision is PROPOSED and has not been approved by any authorized actor."},"output":"{\n  \"createdBy\": {\n    \"actorId\": \"agt_f966eab3a01c47bb\",\n    \"actorType\": \"agent\"\n  },\n  \"agentSessionId\": \"ses_c5b74dd631a2449c\",\n  \"createdAt\": \"2026-10-08T04:35:27.854Z\",\n  \"id\": \"dec_82ef0d50fb394a8a\",\n  \"workspaceId\": \"ws_66892b28c1d640a8\",\n  \"summary\": \"Proposed: for the next shift, acquire correlated end-to-end evidence on IAD /v1/exports failures (100% tracing + export-specific DB/pool metrics) before selecting any remediation; change no production system without incident-lead approval.\",\n  \"rationale\": \"The cause is not established and there is no correlated gateway+application+database trace for any failed export; the DB p95 elevation (~1 s) is far below the 30 s timeout and is all-routes aggregate, so it cannot alone justify a targeted fix. Acting before narrowing the cause risks masking the fault. This decision is PROPOSED and has not been approved by any authorized actor.\",\n  \"status\": \"proposed\",\n  \"updatedAt\": \"2026-10-08T04:35:27.854Z\"\n}","metadata":{"truncated":false},"title":"","time":{"start":1791434127849,"end":1791434127863}},"id":"prt_119cb757d001p5h4ElxRU9shap","sessionID":"ses_ee6357b88ffe0pZB3ogcBnOHmr","messageID":"msg_119cb5209001W3PwO7t1Mjgqev"}}
{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1791434129214,"sessionID":"ses_ee6357b88ffe0pZB3ogcBnOHmr","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"campfire_add_decision","callID":"call_01_4utpinvg6obyww5n8z94d472","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"workspaceId":"ws_66892b28c1d640a8","status":"proposed","summary":"Proposed interim mitigation (pending root cause): make IAD export creation resilient to slow upstreams (bounded retry/backoff and/or async job + polling) to reduce customer-visible 504s.","rationale":"Failures are a minority (26/402, ~6.5%) and IAD-scoped; an async/queue or bounded-retry pattern could reduce customer-visible timeouts while diagnosis continues. This is speculative about root cause and is PROPOSED only; it requires explicit incident-lead approval and should not be applied without it."},"output":"{\n  \"createdBy\": {\n    \"actorId\": \"agt_f966eab3a01c47bb\",\n    \"actorType\": \"agent\"\n  },\n  \"agentSessionId\": \"ses_c5b74dd631a2449c\",\n  \"createdAt\": \"2026-10-08T04:35:29.179Z\",\n  \"id\": \"dec_44cd603a30a54b97\",\n  \"workspaceId\": \"ws_66892b28c1d640a8\",\n  \"summary\": \"Proposed interim mitigation (pending root cause): make IAD export creation resilient to slow upstreams (bounded retry/backoff and/or async job + polling) to reduce customer-visible 504s.\",\n  \"rationale\": \"Failures are a minority (26/402, ~6.5%) and IAD-scoped; an async/queue or bounded-retry pattern could reduce customer-visible timeouts while diagnosis continues. This is speculative about root cause and is PROPOSED only; it requires explicit incident-lead approval and should not be applied without it.\",\n  \"status\": \"proposed\",\n  \"updatedAt\": \"2026-10-08T04:35:29.179Z\"\n}","metadata":{"truncated":false},"title":"","time":{"start":1791434129174,"end":1791434129183}},"id":"prt_119cb7a1e001OtfuQkPLIMjHtF","sessionID":"ses_ee6357b88ffe0pZB3ogcBnOHmr","messageID":"msg_119cb5209001W3PwO7t1Mjgqev"}}
